<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cudgen sells bentonite division.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cudgen sells bentonite division.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Minerals sands miner Cudgen RZ Ltd said on Monday it has sold its bentonite division to Commercial Minerals Ltd for A$10.75 million, effective January 28, 1997.</p>
<p>Cudgen put the Queensland-based mining, processing and sales operation up for sale last September after being 76.7 percent acquired by rival RGC Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
